     1→// Tiny per-card subscriber for the thumbnail cache.
     2→//
     3→// Each MediaCard mounts ONE of these and only re-renders when its OWN
     4→// thumbnail becomes ready. There is no array-wide state and no context —
     5→// flipping a single thumb from "not ready" to "ready" never cascades to
     6→// the rest of the grid, so scrolling stays smooth even while the
